    "detailed_description": "AWA 2024 is a heavily remastered version of the original game. The modifications include a transition to a HD 16:9 gameplay screen, improved bullet patterns for the enemies, much improved graphics with a pixel art look for nostalgia, brand new soundtrack and sound effects, two new aircraft to unlock and a lot more. About the original: AWA (Aircraft Warfare Arcade) is a fast paced shoot-em-up featuring modern military aircraft. Choose one of the ten fighter aircraft and take the battle to the skies throughout nine action-packed stages each with their own special end-level boss.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* 9 action-packed stages each with their own end-level boss<br />\r\n* 10 player fighter aircraft to choose from<br />\r\n* Money system \u2013 earn money with every mission, upgrade or repair your fighter aircraft/buy support drones or special weapons<br />\r\n* Full controller support<br />\r\n* Multi-stage level bosses<br />\r\n* 3 difficulty levels<br />\r\n* Unlockable player fighter aircraft<br />\r\n* Online Leaderboards<br />\r\n* Achievements<br />\r\n<br />\r\nXBOX controller fully supported in-game, partially support for game menus.",
